{"words": [{"text": "كُتِبَ", "translation": "Prescribed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "حَضَرَ", "translation": "approaches"}, {"text": "أَحَدَكُمُ", "translation": "any of you"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتُ", "translation": "[the] death"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "تَرَكَ", "translation": "he leaves"}, {"text": "خَيْرًا", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "ٱلْوَصِيَّةُ", "translation": "(making) the will"}, {"text": "لِلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ", "translation": "for the parents"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ", "translation": "and the near relatives"}, {"text": "بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۖ", "translation": "with due fairness"}, {"text": "حَقًّا", "translation": "a duty"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translation": "the righteous ones"}], "sahih": "Prescribed for you when death approaches [any] one of you if he leaves wealth [is that he should make] a bequest for the parents and near relatives according to what is acceptable - a duty upon the righteous.1"}